; Requirement: asking whether a sheet is the same thing as a plate gets an
; answer, even if the answer is "undetermined".
;
; Observed: the question cannot be written. Sorts keep levels apart, which
; is what we want, but as a type error, not as a verdict. Any bridge
; between levels has to be a function one declares (state-of, plate-of).

(sort Sheet)
(sort Plate)
(constructor sheet (String) Sheet)
(constructor bartsch (String) Plate)

(check (= (sheet "met/41.1.31") (bartsch "78")))
